title: "SZL Holdings Platform — governed AI decision infrastructure (proprietary)"
abstract: >-
  Monorepo for SZL Holdings' governed AI decision infrastructure, including
  the ouroboros-guardrails receipt-chain runtime, the ouroboros-invariant
  Lutar Invariant Λ implementation, and supporting policy/evidence
  packages. This repository is proprietary (see LICENSE). The associated
  thesis (Ouroboros Thesis v10 — EXHAUSTIVE-AUDIT) is published separately
  at szl-holdings/ouroboros-thesis under CC-BY-4.0 and should be cited via
  that repository's CITATION.cff if you are citing the thesis text.
